{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Take the sum, etc.</b> Count from among them those fit for the labor of carrying — and they are from thirty years old until fifty years old. One younger than thirty has not reached full strength; hence the Sages said (Avot 5): \"A thirty-year-old, for strength.\" And one older than fifty — his strength begins to fail from now on."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:17.696908335Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}